{"id":"reconnaissant","lemma":"reconnaissant","pos":"adj","rank":2407,"glosses":["grateful, thankful"],"ipa":"/ʁə.kɔ.nɛ.sɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Fr-reconnaissant.ogg/Fr-reconnaissant.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"reconnaissante","masculinePlural":"reconnaissants","femininePlural":"reconnaissantes"},"examples":[{"text":"Je serais reconnaissant.","en":"I'd be grateful.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Je leur suis reconnaissant.","en":"I am grateful to them.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"them"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes très reconnaissants pour ça.","en":"We're very grateful for that.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Je pensais que tu serais reconnaissante.","en":"I thought you'd be grateful.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Je suis reconnaissant pour ma famille.","en":"I'm thankful for my family.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"family"}]}]}